>* Is the MEDUSA always in a room at the top of a staircase?  (I'd
>  hate to have to blind myself before ascending every staircase,
>  but hmm...maybe that's not such a bad way to play given the
>  sort of nasty characters in the lower levels).
Medusa is always at the top of the down staircase on her level. There
is no danger if you go directly after her on her level, only when you
skip it and come back up. This forces you to go after her the proper way.
Get over the water (levitation, Wands of Cold work well also), use a
blindfold, use your mirror, no problem. If you have to dig down past her
level, put on the blindfold and go up the next up staircase. Remember to
wear the blindfold, or else you die. I would do this immediately so you don't
forget it later. When you clear out the castle, be sure and wish for a Ring
of Levitation.
